==English==

===Etymology===
< {{F.}} {{term|machinerie||machinery}} < {{term|machine|lang=fr||machine}}; see [[machine]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mə-shē'nə-rē}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|machineries}}

# The machines of a production plant etc. collectively.
# The working [[part]]s of a [[machine]] as a group.
# The [[collective]] parts of something which allow it to [[function]].

